  "question": "A patient with severe viral pneumonia develops rapidly worsening hypoxemia, hypotension, bilateral pulmonary opacities, and markedly elevated inflammatory markers, including C-reactive protein, ferritin, and D-dimer. Which pathophysiologic mechanism is most characteristic of a cytokine storm?",
