      "text": "A failure of innate immune sensing that prevents cytokine production entirely"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "Dysregulated activation of monocytes, macrophages, and other immune cells with excessive release of pro-inflammatory cytokines such as IL-6, IL-1β, and TNF-α"
