        "Use x = (-b ± √D)/(2a).",
        "x = (3 ± √25)/4.",
        "x = (3 ± 5)/4.",
        "The solutions are x = 2 and x = -1/2."
      ],
      "verification": "Both values make the original expression equal to zero."
    },
    {
