        "Expand: A(x) = -x² + 6x + 16.",
        "Complete the square: A(x) = -(x - 3)² + 25.",
        "The vertex occurs at x = 3 and gives a maximum area of 25 square units.",
        "The length is 3 + 2 = 5 units and the width is 8 - 3 = 5 units."
