      "Describe Brønsted-Lowry acids as proton donors and Brønsted-Lowry bases as proton acceptors.",
      "Explain that pH measures hydronium ion activity and that lower pH values indicate greater acidity in aqueous solutions.",
      "Interpret pH measurements of common household substances.",
      "Explain that the pH scale is logarithmic: a one-unit pH difference represents approximately a tenfold difference in hydronium ion concentration.",
