        "Write the Hamiltonian as H(λ) = H₀ + λV.",
        "Choose H₀ so that its eigenstates |n⁽⁰⁾⟩ and energies Eₙ⁽⁰⁾ are known.",
        "Expand Eₙ and ψₙ in powers of λ and insert the expansions into the Schrödinger equation.",
        "Collect terms of equal powers of λ and solve order by order."
