        "Contrast open euchromatin with compact heterochromatin.",
        "Connect chromatin accessibility to transcription-factor binding, enhancer-promoter communication, and RNA polymerase II recruitment."
      ],
      "student_work": [
        "Sketch the flow from DNA sequence to nucleosome to accessible or inaccessible chromatin to transcription.",
