        "Explain how promoter methylation can reduce regulatory-protein binding or recruit repressive chromatin proteins.",
        "Compare promoter methylation with gene-body and enhancer methylation.",
        "Briefly note that methylation patterns differ among eukaryotic organisms."
      ],
      "student_work": [
        "Complete a three-column chart for DNA location, typical effect, and mechanism.",
        "Predict what may happen to a promoter when methylation increases."
      ],
      "formative_check": "Ask why a methylated promoter is not automatically equivalent to a completely silent gene."
    },
    {
      "phase": "4. Histone modifications, remodeling, and card sort",
