      "teacher_moves": [
        "Explain histone acetylation, methylation, phosphorylation, and ubiquitin-mediated regulation at a conceptual level.",
        "Introduce readers, writers, and erasers of histone marks.",
        "Discuss H3K4me3, H3K27ac, H3K9me3, and H3K27me3 as examples.",
        "Introduce ATP-dependent chromatin remodeling and Polycomb-related repression.",
        "Facilitate the chromatin-state mechanism card sort."
      ],
      "student_work": [
        "Sort mechanism cards into open or active-associated, repressive-associated, context-dependent, or post-transcriptional categories.",
