        "Explain genomic imprinting as parent-of-origin-specific regulation.",
        "Briefly connect these mechanisms to differentiation and dosage compensation."
      ],
      "student_work": [
        "Build a two-column table comparing post-transcriptional silencing and chromatin-mediated silencing.",
        "Explain why imprinting requires marks that distinguish maternal and paternal alleles."
