        "Identify the minimum combination of assays needed to support a mechanistic claim."
      ],
      "formative_check": "Students distinguish a mark measurement from a gene-expression measurement and from a functional perturbation."
    },
    {
      "phase": "7. Cooperative data investigation",
      "time_minutes": 15,
