            "Tamper-evident log storage",
            "Anomaly detection and alerting",
            "Incident containment, recovery, and key-revocation procedures"
          ],
          "limitations": [
            "Logs may contain sensitive data",
            "Insiders may misuse legitimate access",
            "Detection is delayed if events are incomplete or untrusted"
          ]
        },
        {
          "mechanism": "Software supply-chain protection",
          "examples": [
            "Dependency and vulnerability scanning",
            "Signed builds and deployment artifacts",
            "Software bills of materials",
            "Controlled patch and update processes"
          ],
          "limitations": [
