        "key_point": "Sensitivity functions connect performance to stability",
        "explanation": "For a SISO negative-feedback loop, S = 1/(1 + PC) measures sensitivity to output disturbances and model perturbations, while T = PC/(1 + PC) is the complementary-sensitivity function."
