        "key_point": "H∞ control addresses worst-case amplification",
        "explanation": "The H∞ norm is the maximum frequency-domain gain of a stable system. Weighted H∞ design emphasizes frequency ranges where disturbance rejection, control limitation, or uncertainty reduction is most important."
