      "assessment": "Use a quick observation checklist for scientific accuracy, reasoning, and ability to identify trade-offs.",
      "teacher_prompts": [
        "Which traits are easy to measure, and which may be difficult?",
        "Could a trait be economically valuable but harmful to welfare?",
        "What environmental information is needed to interpret the data?"
