        "Best_Response_Form": "si* must belong to BRi(s−i*) for every player i.",
        "Existence_Result": "Every finite game has at least one Nash equilibrium when pure and mixed strategies are allowed. This does not guarantee a fully mixed or unique equilibrium.",
