        "Bruner emphasizes guided discovery, the organization of knowledge, and spiral curriculum development.",
        "Ausubel emphasizes meaningful verbal learning, anchoring to prior knowledge, and advance organizers.",
        "Von Glasersfeld emphasizes the learner's active construction of viable interpretations of experience."
