        "ID": "KP6",
        "Point": "Material factual comparison",
        "Explanation": "A later case need not contain identical facts. The question is whether the earlier legal principle can properly be extended to the new factual or legal context. Courts should not distinguish a case merely to avoid an inconvenient or unpopular result."
