      "Explain the major dimensions of bureaucratic accountability: legal, political, administrative, financial, social, professional and performance-based.",
      "Describe the principal mechanisms used to hold public agencies and officials accountable.",
      "Discuss the relationship among accountability, rule of law, public interest, ethical conduct and organizational learning."
