      "Explain the case using at least four theories or reform paradigms.",
      "For each theory, identify the mechanism, relevant evidence, likely benefit, and likely risk.",
      "Propose a reform using balanced performance measures.",
      "Explain how frontline discretion should be structured rather than simply eliminated."
