      {
        "feature": "Parody and pastiche",
        "explanation": "Parody usually imitates a recognizable style or text with a critical distance or satirical target. Pastiche imitates a style without necessarily maintaining an obvious critical target.",
        "manifestations": "Mock epics, fake scholarly editions, imitation detective novels, fabricated archives, and stylized fragments of existing genres."
