      {
        "difficulty": "Confusion among postmodernism, poststructuralism, modernism, and contemporaneity",
        "misconception": "The terms are interchangeable",
        "scaffold": "Use a four-column comparison chart with defining questions, historical contexts, common strategies, and representative examples"
