      {
        "difficulty": "Legal and ethical issues are oversimplified.",
        "common_error": "Applying rules from one legal context to all cyber situations.",
        "teaching_response": "Distinguish peacetime cybersecurity, law enforcement, intelligence activity, and armed conflict; invite legal or policy expertise when needed."
      },
      {
        "difficulty": "Students overlook civilian and societal consequences.",
        "common_error": "Evaluating an option only through organizational or military effectiveness.",
        "teaching_response": "Include privacy, essential services, public trust, human rights, disproportionate effects, and unintended escalation in every tabletop discussion."
      },
      {
