  "analytical_thesis": "The sea represents the forces of change, time, and mortality that continually alter human experience. At the same time, its shifting appearance reflects the characters' unstable perceptions and emotions. It therefore connects the novel's philosophical concerns with its formal interest in time, memory, and artistic representation.",
